2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"uZm_1Fpul6ulhLnimcv36A","review_id":"4bipr88d0SnRGT3x269KfA","date":"2019-09-18T17:26:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9418345093727112,"text_excerpt":"I just got the gyro wrap combo (wrap, fries, cold canned soda or bottle of water) and for the price, and amount of food, I'm stoked. I'll be visiting these guys more often now that I know they're good. I noticed this place had a line (albeit quick moving!) while the truck next to it didn't have anybody ordering. Probably a good sign!"},{"business_id":"uZm_1Fpul6ulhLnimcv36A","review_id":"ALmkhCVij2dllZn6WXju0w","date":"2019-06-17T16:08:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.941637396812439,"text_excerpt":"We were sitting at Second Line Brewing talking about where we wanted to go eat. And the truck rolled up. We decided to give them a try which meant we didn't have to leave Second Line. My wife and I split the gyro combo. The gyro was good and the fries were nicely seasoned (not real heavy). The couple with us bought the Philly cheese steak combo. They finished that pretty quick. The food was good and it definitely beat getting in the truck and driving somewhere."},{"business_id":"uZm_1Fpul6ulhLnimcv36A","review_id":"rGEqNm8JrGASfoI04PXiWA","date":"2019-04-16T21:27:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9127762317657471,"text_excerpt":"I was in dire need of lunch and this truck came to my rescue. A veggie burger was just what I wanted. There version was interesting in that it was a bit... chunky, like whole edamame chunky. And really tasty. I could have lived without the plastic cheese but for $8 my combo included the burger, fries and a canned drink. Great deal! The service was super quick too. I'll have to try the falafel next time. LOVE their logo!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
